BT 1 0 0 1 2 130.4 Tm /F3 7.6 Tf 9.2 TL (Goal: test record, prioritised findings and before/after design checkpoint) Tj T* (Audience: Adults using a community wellness service, including users with varied digital confidence and) Tj T* (  accessibility needs.) Tj T* (Context: Evaluate the prototype with a realistic task, heuristic review and accessibility checks, then) Tj T* (  perform one evidence-led iteration.) Tj T* (Required content: Use realistic service names, appointment times, success, empty, loading, permission and) Tj T* (  error states.) Tj T* (Design system: Use the supplied tokens and component rules. Prefer clear labels, visible focus, 44px minimum) Tj T* (  targets and strong contrast.) Tj T* (Constraints: Mobile-first; no lorem ipsum; one dominant primary action per screen; preserve user input on) Tj T* (  recoverable errors.) Tj T* (Acceptance: Metrics defined before testing; Findings cite evidence; Accessibility covers states; Retest uses) Tj T* (  the same task) Tj T* (Output: Create the named design in Claude Design, save a version checkpoint and export or share the evidence) Tj T* (  requested in the README.) Tj T* ET
